{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序十作卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以方言不同本傳。凡三出其名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其名稱呼不同。如達磨多羅之類。凡三四說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即雙峯是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "達磨未繼世作\n祖。故未稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二祖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十三祖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十六祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十七祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十\n八祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "達磨達同學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五祖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不言達磨以其為此土初祖也。若\n總以西土言之。乃有二十八祖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時慶三祖璨師舍利作齋"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0768005", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】增上寺報恩藏明本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0769a1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0769a1401", "type": "add", "text": "僭【CB】，僣【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0771c2901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0771c2901", "type": "add", "text": "傳【CB】，傅【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0772a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0772a0101", "type": "add", "text": "僧【CB】，增【大】"}
